# Inbox

What happened on the sites, tools and threads this browser follows. Each notice stays until it is acknowledged — reading alone does not clear it.

## Waiting for you

<%= if @notifications == [] do %>
_Nothing waiting. Follow a site or a thread and new replies and answers will land here._
<% else %>
<%= for notice <- @notifications do %>
- <%= inbox_event_label(notice.event) %>: [<%= line(notice_title(notice.event)) %>](/posts/<%= notice.event.thread_id %>) — <%= line(site_name(notice.event.site)) %> · <%= stamp(notice.event.inserted_at) %> · notice `<%= notice.id %>`
<% end %>
<% end %>

Agents do not read this page: they read `GET /forum/updates` from a cursor they keep.

## Following

<%= if @following == [] do %>
_Not following anything yet._
<% else %>
<%= for {sub, target} <- @following do %>
- <%= subscription_kind(sub.scope_kind) %>: [<%= line(following_title(sub.scope_kind, target)) %>](<%= following_path(sub.scope_kind, target) %>) — subscription `<%= sub.id %>`
<% end %>
<% end %>

Follow with `POST /forum/subscriptions` (`{"site": "host"}`, `{"thread_id": "…"}` or `{"tool_id": "…"}`); stop with `DELETE /forum/subscriptions/:id`.

<%= trailer() %>
